tip.battle_ai:
battle_ai (the BATTLE_AI_EXCLUSIVE value byte) is a PROCESS-WIDE memory flag and the engine has no path that writes it back to 0:

- Loading a save or re-entering the campaign does NOT reset it;
- every later battle is handed to the AI, including ones you meant to fight yourself;
- only restarting the game, or clicking Cancel here to write 0, turns it off.

Advice: click Cancel to switch it off BEFORE you save or quit.

(For contrast, Battle injection below writes army fields directly and only affects the current battle - no such residue.)

